abstract: >-
  Hromada-level dataset for Ukraine joining strike and air-raid-alert
  exposure, local budget indicators and night-light recovery measures,
  at hromada level (raion level near the front line and border). Aggregated open data;
  sensitive detail withheld under published security rules.
keywords:
  - Ukraine
  - hromada
  - war
  - night lights
  - local government finance
  - spatial analysis
  - recovery
